I left out the `http-client` import. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and that clause is its entire authority. Adding `http-client` would widen the grant, and sending the item's untrusted text to an outside host would be data exfiltration. If the platform team has approved the grant, the `with` clause needs to be amended first. Once it is, the fetch can be added.

